{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06660","headline":"题虬上人房 · 储光羲","name":"题虬上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅宫分两地，释子一爲心。\n入道无来去，清言见古今。\n江寒池水绿，山[暝]竹园深。\n别有中天月，遥遥散夕阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06660.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06660","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"郭扬波"}